tish scholar and his American wife bought an island, spent decades preserving Gaelic culture]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133533553.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Scottish Gaelic scholar John Lorne Campbell and American musician Margaret Fay Shaw bought the remote islands of Canna and Sanday in 1938 and made Canna House their home. For decades, they collected Gaelic songs, stories, photographs and historical records. In 1981, Campbell gifted Canna, their home and their extensive collections to the National Trust for Scotland, preserving their life’s work for future generations.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/a-scottish-scholar-and-his-american-wife-bought-the-remote-island-of-canna-43-years-later-they-gifted-it-their-home-and-their-lifes-work-preserving-gaelic-culture-to-the-national-trust-for-scotland/articleshow/133533553.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/a-scottish-scholar-and-his-american-wife-bought-the-remote-island-of-canna-43-years-later-they-gifted-it-their-home-and-their-lifes-work-preserving-gaelic-culture-to-the-national-trust-for-scotland/articleshow/133533553.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T14:45:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133533925,imgsize-101426.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Ancient DNA reveals two unknown human lineages hidden in modern genomes]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133531501.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/scientists-found-traces-of-two-unknown-ancient-human-lineages-hiding-in-modern-dna-one-split-from-our-ancestors-about-800000-years-ago-another-around-1-8-million-years-ago/articleshow/133531501.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/scientists-found-traces-of-two-unknown-ancient-human-lineages-hiding-in-modern-dna-one-split-from-our-ancestors-about-800000-years-ago-another-around-1-8-million-years-ago/articleshow/133531501.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T13:15:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133531598,imgsize-92552.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Ohio workers rescue kitten from excavator; now she has a hard hat and a job]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133534809.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/ohio-construction-workers-found-a-kitten-trapped-inside-an-excavator-now-she-has-her-own-hard-hat-and-a-job-working-with-them/articleshow/133534809.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/ohio-construction-workers-found-a-kitten-trapped-inside-an-excavator-now-she-has-her-own-hard-hat-and-a-job-working-with-them/articleshow/133534809.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T14:12:33+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133535002,imgsize-1118278.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[How a family reunion in China ended in a 3-year prison term for artist Gao Zhen]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133533651.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Chinese artist Gao Zhen received a three-year prison sentence for his satirical artwork.  Authorities charged him with "infringing upon the reputation of heroes" for his art.  Gao's wife expressed deep disappointment and sadness over the unexpected conviction.  His supporters argue the artworks predate the law under which he was prosecuted.  The sentence highlights China's narrowing space for artistic and political expression.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/how-a-family-reunion-in-china-ended-in-a-3-year-prison-term-for-artist-gao-zhen/articleshow/133533651.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/how-a-family-reunion-in-china-ended-in-a-3-year-prison-term-for-artist-gao-zhen/articleshow/133533651.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T13:11:32+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vijaya Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133533893,imgsize-224906.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Columbia engineers develop pigment-free coating that kept surfaces 6°C cooler under Arizona sun]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133532403.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Columbia Engineering researchers developed a porous polymer coating that can cool surfaces below the surrounding air temperature without using electricity. The coating replaces conventional white pigments with nano-to-microscale air voids that reflect sunlight and release heat towards the sky. Tests showed the surface stayed about 6°C below ambient temperature in Arizona and 3°C below it in Bangladesh.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/columbia-engineers-built-a-pigment-free-polymer-coating-filled-with-microscopic-air-pores-under-arizona-desert-sun-the-coated-surface-stayed-about-6c-below-ambient-air/articleshow/133532403.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/columbia-engineers-built-a-pigment-free-polymer-coating-filled-with-microscopic-air-pores-under-arizona-desert-sun-the-coated-surface-stayed-about-6c-below-ambient-air/articleshow/133532403.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T14:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133533395,imgsize-112714.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[47-year-old California pastor makes college football roster 30 years after an injury ended his career]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133533300.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/47-year-old-california-pastor-makes-college-football-roster-30-years-after-an-injury-ended-his-career-inspired-by-a-video-of-a-60-year-old-player/articleshow/133533300.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/47-year-old-california-pastor-makes-college-football-roster-30-years-after-an-injury-ended-his-career-inspired-by-a-video-of-a-60-year-old-player/articleshow/133533300.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T13:00:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133533550,imgsize-902969.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Nimaya Williams earns $40,000 BigFuture scholarship as one of only two students nationwide]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133532181.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Nimaya Williams has achieved a remarkable milestone by securing a $40,000 scholarship from College Board's BigFuture. This accolade was awarded to her for completing various college and career planning tasks available on their platform. The financial support alleviates a significant burden for her family regarding higher education costs, showcasing how strategic planning can create unforeseen pathways to success.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-nimaya-williams-the-north-carolina-junior-who-completed-free-college-planning-steps-and-became-one-of-only-two-students-nationwide-to-receive-a-40000-bigfuture-scholarship/articleshow/133532181.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-nimaya-williams-the-north-carolina-junior-who-completed-free-college-planning-steps-and-became-one-of-only-two-students-nationwide-to-receive-a-40000-bigfuture-scholarship/articleshow/133532181.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T12:55:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133532440,imgsize-1455662.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[6,500-year-old human tooth found in Serbian museum collection]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133532914.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/6500-years-ago-someone-drilled-a-human-tooth-and-wore-it-as-a-pendant-archaeologists-found-it-sitting-in-a-serbian-museum-collection/articleshow/133532914.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/6500-years-ago-someone-drilled-a-human-tooth-and-wore-it-as-a-pendant-archaeologists-found-it-sitting-in-a-serbian-museum-collection/articleshow/133532914.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T12:30:50+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133533088,imgsize-35708.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Texas wildfire jumps creeks and rivers as powerful winds drive rapid spread]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133532518.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/texas-wildfire-jumps-creeks-and-rivers-as-powerful-winds-drive-rapid-spread/articleshow/133532518.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/texas-wildfire-jumps-creeks-and-rivers-as-powerful-winds-drive-rapid-spread/articleshow/133532518.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T12:15:01+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Roy</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133532564,imgsize-117654.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Savannah audited 39,000 Flock searches and found 34 unjustified; 4 employees arrested]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133531276.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Four former Savannah Police Department employees have been arrested over alleged misuse of the Flock Safety license plate reader system. The arrests followed an internal audit of 39,000 searches, which flagged 127 for review and found 34 were unjustified. Six employees were fired, while the Georgia Bureau of Investigation continues to investigate the case.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/savannah-audited-39000-flock-searches-and-found-34-unjustified-6-employees-were-fired-and-4-have-now-been-arrested/articleshow/133531276.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/savannah-audited-39000-flock-searches-and-found-34-unjustified-6-employees-were-fired-and-4-have-now-been-arrested/articleshow/133531276.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-26T14:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</d